{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:product-identity-profile\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物为合成药X，产品身份为合成药X注射制剂；剂型为注射制剂，规格为150 mg/1.0 mL，给药途径为皮下给药。适应症为慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉，研究分期为Ⅱ期。安慰剂为生理盐水1.0 mL，皮下注射，同体积、同途径、同频率。剂量方案包括负荷给药期和维持给药期：负荷给药期为第1天至第22天，第1、8、15、22天给药，每周一次，共4次，每次150 mg/1.0 mL，皮下给药；维持给药期为第36天起至第24周（末次给药），每两周一次，每次150 mg/1.0 mL，皮下给药。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:structure-applicability\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"化学结构/分子式适用性结论：适用；理由：基于IL-4Rα拮抗机制，适用于2型炎症驱动的慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:mechanism\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"作用机制：合成药X为IL-4Rα拮抗剂，靶点为IL-4Rα，通过阻断IL-4和IL-13信号通路，抑制2型炎症反应。本作用机制为继承义务（继承自 background.mechanism 语义），并作为声明的实质性补充；源 @284 仅列研发代号/化学名/结构式/理化性质，未显式含机制表述，故不反向引用源文作为机制已含证据。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"8cc9a07a0f23d41a89ff46fcb96b29888519cf58df394c113c43eac95602b7f6"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:077faf89b1485dd69b59e8539ff0d48ae5c0a05697ac973486784ad740466ff1:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:077faf89b1485dd69b59e8539ff0d48ae5c0a05697ac973486784ad740466ff1:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"e91ebacb525b87f3e4fa9a405fe548a4e39e7fa96cd0670dfffacd21a94a35b3","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab814